  "description": "Allows you to use secrets from 1Password during development. Supports secrets set via `appsettings.json`, environment variable, or any other method that is compatible with the `IConfiguration` interface. Automatically injects secrets from 1Password by finding all `IConfiguration` entries that contain a 1Password secret reference and resolves them by invoking the `op` CLI.",
